{"code":"ER_WRONG_ARGUMENTS","errno":1210,"level":"error","message":"GET ALL ISSUES ERROR Incorrect arguments to mysqld_stmt_execute","sql":"\n      SELECT\n        i.id,\n        i.request_id,\n        i.issue_date,\n        i.due_date,\n        i.return_date,\n        i.fine_amount,\n        i.status,\n\n        u.id AS student_id,\n        CONCAT(u.first_name,' ',u.last_name)\n        AS student_name,\n        u.email,\n\n        b.id AS book_id,\n        b.title,\n        b.author,\n        b.book_num,\n        b.category\n\n      FROM issues i\n\n      JOIN users u\n        ON i.student_id = u.id\n\n      JOIN books b\n        ON i.book_id = b.id\n\n      WHERE 1=1\n    \n      ORDER BY i.created_at DESC\n      LIMIT ?\n      OFFSET ?\n    ","sqlMessage":"Incorrect arguments to mysqld_stmt_execute","sqlState":"HY000","stack":"Error: Incorrect arguments to mysqld_stmt_execute\n    at getAllIssues (file:///D:/About_LexiconNetworks/Library_Management_System/backend/src/controllers/issue.controller.js:95:31)\n    at Layer.handleRequest (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_modules\\router\\lib\\layer.js:152:17)\n    at next (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_modules\\router\\lib\\route.js:157:13)\n    at file:///D:/About_LexiconNetworks/Library_Management_System/backend/src/middlewares/schema.validator.middleware.js:70:7\n    at Layer.handleRequest (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_modules\\router\\lib\\layer.js:152:17)\n    at next (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_modules\\router\\lib\\route.js:157:13)\n    at file:///D:/About_LexiconNetworks/Library_Management_System/backend/src/middlewares/auth.middleware.js:102:7\n    at Layer.handleRequest (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_modules\\router\\lib\\layer.js:152:17)\n    at next (D:\\About_LexiconNetworks\\Library_Management_System\\backend\\node_